      heading: "Tips for Maximizing Your Savings",
      content: `<p>Stack offers wisely — Use a sign-up bonus on your first transfer, then switch to referral bonuses for ongoing savings. Some providers (like WorldRemit) let you apply a promo code on top of the standard rate.</p>
<p>Compare total cost, not just the promo — A $25 bonus from Remitly is worthless if a different provider saves you $40 on the exchange rate. Always use our <a href="/send-money">comparison tool</a> to check the total received amount.</p>
<p>Set up referral links early — Create your referral links before you need them. Share them with friends and family who also send money abroad. <a href="/companies/remitly">Remitly's</a> unlimited $25 referrals can add up to hundreds of dollars per year.</p>
<p>Join loyalty programs immediately — MoneyGram Plus Rewards and InstaReM InstaPoints are free to join. Even if the per-transfer savings seem small, they compound over time, especially with MoneyGram's Premier tier (40% off every 5th transfer).</p>
<p>Check for seasonal promotions — Providers often run special deals around holidays, festivals, and cultural events (Diwali, Eid, Chinese New Year, Christmas). These can include boosted exchange rates, fee-free transfers, or double referral rewards.</p>
<p>Use the right provider for the right transfer — Don't stick with one provider. Use Remitly for small remittances (great sign-up bonus), TorFX for large transfers (GBP 50 referral), and Wise for everyday transfers (best exchange rate). See our <a href="/guides/best-money-transfer-services">best money transfer services rankings</a> for a full breakdown.</p>`,
